lor:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">4) Width: 510mm,520mm,980mm,1020mm,1270mm,1280mm,1600mm,1620mm,others </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">5) Length: 4000 ,4500,6000m</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">6.) Package : use bubble film and kraft paper</span></span></span></p> </span></span></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');
